gest":"sha256:83c0779459b7afe5a21cd2070dc7bc9f4a11b33b59ea3370a0dd5cd0d0cbba6c","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-09-28T06:14:56Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T06:14:56Z"},{"id":594669928,"node_id":"RA_kwDOIVhnxM4jcfFo","name":"sqly_1.7.3_windows_arm64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":12137019,"digest":"sha256:0720174054747118536d84624639c33fbb2b4bc31c4d2a93a840d964d859e424","download_count":19,"created_at":"2026-09-28T06:14:51Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T06:14:52Z"},{"id":594670090,"node_id":"RA_kwDOIVhnxM4jcfIK","name":"sqly_1.7.3_windows_arm64.zip.sbom.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":90064,"digest":"sha256:71c5a135c21c9cd6beb728f4f5b447a2bec62836c3299a71896965182b98dd9b","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-09-28T06:14:55Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T06:14:56Z"}],"body":"## sqly v1.7.3\n\nRun SQL over CSV, TSV, LTSV, JSON, JSONL, Parquet, Excel, ACH, Fedwire, and\nsupported compressed inputs (.gz, .bz2, .xz, .zst, .z, .snappy, .s2, .lz4).\n\nInstall or upgrade, then see the grouped highlights below. Every artifact is\nsigned and ships with an SBOM and build provenance — see\n[Verifying release integrity](https://github.com/nao1215/sqly#verifying-release-integrity).\n\n## Changelog\n### Features\n* be995856c0e59c8efece3df0de838742b92b77fa: feat(model): format a result a row at a time with RowStream (@nao1215)\n### Bug fixes\n* f374a2b616f17e756882acf0a9b75c0ed7b1e24e: fix(save): count NULL set over an empty string as a change (@nao1215)\n* f6b112cc7c3c77ad34cbc4b7c7dff34995841935: fix(save): count a change of storage class as a change (@nao1215)\n### Performance\n* e6b5391261edc76a8bcc0e7b8192e7d6a7786537: perf(output): buffer query output and encode JSON keys once (@nao1215)\n* cf4bf82be38c9fd4eeb50e5782ac92f020de2848: perf(output): stream query results printed as CSV, TSV, JSON or JSON Lines (@nao1215)\n* af11aa592b59fd8c46583b6b9aa44bd9c841f4b4: perf(shell): take no import baseline in runs that cannot write back (@nao1215)\n### Documentation\n* 25255a4ed2d16a9ae6bec676688c7621031db649: docs(changelog): mention storage class changes in the .save fix (@nao1215)\n* a7697d6a25ef5a54c7139f3e16bd67ad0daf80a1: docs(website): add a Benchmark page comparing sqly with trdsql, csvq, textql and DuckDB (@nao1215)\n* cd6447c039aac5a2ab13b29e10753b09cf8b2538: docs(website): measure the Benchmark page with filesql v0.59.2 (@nao1215)\n* bfe87d2288023996511e32cfc2a1b7c7d06834e3: docs(website): measure the Benchmark page with streamed output (@nao1215)\n* dccd98fd0f89dddf17d47bd0a13f15f73eef7513: docs: stop calling slsa-verifier provenance checks offline (#999) (@nao1215)\n### Others\n* f4657f4e1741866a163284d6cc99b7a6789f56b5: Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into perf/import-overhead (@nao1215)\n* e0989ff8c2223a2a39d82e61bef37dcfa244f0bd: Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into perf/stream-output (@nao1215)\n* eee6260b5e4971574c52d2660efde6e85311fbb3: build(deps): update filesql to v0.59.2 (@nao1215)\n\n**Full changelog**: https://github.com/nao1215/sqly/compare/v1.7.2...v1.7.3\n\n","mentions_count":1}
